WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:03.315
On a phone, Rutt Etra Web turns into a camera.

2
00:00:03.315 --> 00:00:06.783
The picture fills the screen, and the controls float over it.

3
00:00:07.236 --> 00:00:08.030
Pick a source.

4
00:00:08.030 --> 00:00:11.379
Webcam is the front camera on a phone, so this is a selfie.

5
00:00:11.379 --> 00:00:16.941
You can also use the back camera, a video from your library, or the pattern with no camera at all.

6
00:00:17.395 --> 00:00:20.033
Swipe the looks along the bottom, and tap one.

7
00:00:20.033 --> 00:00:23.246
Each look is a whole color and feel, applied in one tap.

8
00:00:23.898 --> 00:00:25.987
Drag on the picture to orbit around it.

9
00:00:28.308 --> 00:00:31.187
The flip button swaps between the front and back camera.

10
00:00:31.651 --> 00:00:33.975
In Photo mode, the shutter saves a picture.

11
00:00:33.975 --> 00:00:38.245
On a phone, it opens your share sheet, so you can send it straight to a friend.

12
00:00:38.707 --> 00:00:40.844
Switch to Video, and the shutter records.

13
00:00:40.844 --> 00:00:44.233
Tap it again to stop, and the clip is saved, with a Share button.

14
00:00:45.909 --> 00:00:47.886
The tabs open the real controls.

15
00:00:47.886 --> 00:00:53.943
Source starts with the same four choices: front camera, back camera, your library, or the pattern.

16
00:00:54.393 --> 00:00:58.463
Shape holds the scan processor: size, position, depth and rotation.

17
00:00:58.463 --> 00:01:02.473
Drag any bar to change it, and watch the picture behind the sheet.

18
00:01:02.933 --> 00:01:06.648
More has presets, recording options, sharing, and the manual.

19
00:01:07.101 --> 00:01:10.511
Turn the phone sideways, and the shutter moves to the edge.

20
00:01:10.511 --> 00:01:13.171
The Patch Bay and Timeline are on the desktop.

21
00:01:13.171 --> 00:01:15.599
Everything you save opens in either place.
